1
00:00:00,902 --> 00:00:03,902
- What are you talking about?
- You forget what Penny did to you?

2
00:00:04,072 --> 00:00:07,872
(Raj:)It took you two years and defiling my
sister to turn that frown upside down.

3
00:00:08,327 --> 00:00:11,207
(Leonard:)I didn't defile your sister,
we had a relationship.

4
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:14,420
(Raj:)I heard you call her Brown Sugar.

5
00:00:14,833 --> 00:00:17,543
(Raj:)In my book that's defilement.

6
00:00:17,753 --> 00:00:21,463
- You wanna know my opinion?
- Oh, boy, do I.

7
00:00:22,841 --> 00:00:24,511
(Sheldon:)Sarcasm?

8
00:00:24,676 --> 00:00:25,966
(Sheldon:)No.

9
00:00:27,554 --> 00:00:29,554
(Sheldon:)All right, then.

10
00:00:29,765 --> 00:00:33,015
(Sheldon:)The reason you're fixated on
a good-natured simpleton like Penny...

11
00:00:33,185 --> 00:00:36,935
(Sheldon:)...is that she's the exact opposite
of your first romantic attachment...

12
00:00:37,105 --> 00:00:39,195
(Sheldon:)...your brilliant, yet intimidating,
mother.

13
00:00:39,649 --> 00:00:41,489
(Leonard:)Where on earth did you get that from?

14
00:00:41,693 --> 00:00:44,613
(Sheldon:)It's in her book
Needy Baby, Greedy Baby.

15
00:00:47,407 --> 00:00:48,987
(Leonard:)That doesn't make it true.

16
00:00:49,159 --> 00:00:51,619
(Sheldon:)It's called non-fiction for a reason,
Leonard.

17
00:00:52,621 --> 00:00:53,701
See you Iater.

18
00:00:55,457 --> 00:00:57,537
If they make a movie version
of that book...

19
00:00:57,709 --> 00:01:02,019
(Raj:)...you know who should play
Leonard's mother? Sandra Bullock.

